.TH PAD_DOWN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
pad_down \- True while the gamepad button is held (requires EngineConfig.gamepad and a connected pad; false otherwise)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool pad_down(const Input *in, PadButton b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True while the gamepad button is held (requires EngineConfig.gamepad and a connected pad; false otherwise). Axes are in in\->pad_axis[AXIS_*] as \-1..1. Button names are positional (PAD_SOUTH is A on Xbox, Cross on PlayStation, B on Nintendo) so the same code works on every controller.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if button b is held this frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pad_pressed (3),
.BR PadButton (3),
.BR PadAxis (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
